# Copy to <repo>/.github/CODEOWNERS and edit. Required in every repo:
# CODEOWNERS does not inherit from eye2gene/.github, and without it
# "Require review from Code Owners" silently enforces nothing (SOP-25 §5.1.3.5).
# Handles must be @eye2gene/<team> with write access. Later rules win.
# The Project Lead must resolve as an owner.

*                  @eye2gene/technical-leads

# Regulated repos: QA co-owns process and QMS-facing files. Keep the Project Lead's
# team on every line: the last matching line replaces the ones above it.
# /.github/        @eye2gene/quality-assurance @eye2gene/technical-leads
# /docs/           @eye2gene/quality-assurance @eye2gene/technical-leads
# /CHANGELOG.md    @eye2gene/quality-assurance @eye2gene/technical-leads
